          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kibunja ane otwogindeng’ung’ lakwanito, atononjinechi baba, alenji, Ngot ko mamutun inendet, ko kabunja chalwogoto betusiek tugul, eng’ taitab baba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eng’ noto anyun, asain ale, Chamwa atebi aek otwogindeng’ung’, inye kiptaiyandennyu, ageeregei weri; ak ingowo weri kotogosta koboto tupchosiekyik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
